{"seq":83,"slug":"r-language-data-analysis","title":"R 语言与数据分析","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# R 语言与数据分析\n\nR 诞生于 1993 年新西兰奥克兰大学，经过三十余年迭代已成为统计分析、临床试验、金融风控和学术研究的事实标准语言。截至 2026 年，CRAN 托管超过 22,000 个包，Bioconductor 额外提供 2,300 余个生命科学专用包，构成了任何统计语言中最庞大的领域生态。R 4.6 系列（2026 年发布）延续了对数值精度、包管理和 ALTREP 内存优化的持续改进，而 tidyverse 核心包（dplyr 1.2、ggplot2 4.0、purrr 1.2）则在语法一致性和性能上再次拉高标杆。\n\n本 hub 覆盖 R 作为数据分析语言的完整实践路径——从类型系统与向量化核心机制，到 tidyverse 现代数据科学工作流，再到贝叶斯推断、生存分析等统计计算前沿，最终落地为 Shiny 应用和 Quarto 可复现报告。\n\n## 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n- **python-advanced**：聚焦 Python 生态的数据科学（pandas、scikit-learn、PyTorch），本 hub 不重复 Python 内容，而专注 R 的统计建模优势和 tidyverse 范式。\n- **julia-scientific-computing**：侧重 Julia 的高性能科学计算（类型分派、GPU 编译），本 hub 讨论 R 在统计推断和可复现研究领域的不可替代性。\n- **probability-statistics**：提供概率论与数理统计的理论基础，本 hub 假设读者已有基本统计素养，聚焦「如何用 R 实现」。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n建议按章节顺序推进：先掌握「基础」章（数据类型、向量化、包生态），再进入「Tidyverse」章学习现代数据操作范式，然后根据兴趣选择「统计计算」或「应用」章深入。具有 Python 数据分析经验的读者可以快速浏览基础章后直接进入 Tidyverse。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基本编程概念（变量、函数、控制流）\n- 基础统计学（均值、方差、假设检验、回归的直觉理解）\n- 命令行操作基础（安装包、运行脚本）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"r-data-types-structures","title":"R 数据类型与结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/r-data-types-structures"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vectorized-operations","title":"向量化运算与函数式编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/vectorized-operations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"r-package-ecosystem","title":"R 包生态与开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/r-package-ecosystem"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"tidyverse","title":"Tidyverse 现代数据科学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dplyr-data-manipulation","title":"dplyr 数据操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/dplyr-data-manipulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ggplot2-visualization","title":"ggplot2 可视化体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/ggplot2-visualization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tidyr-purrr-pipeline","title":"tidyr 与 purrr 管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/tidyr-purrr-pipeline"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"statistical-computing","title":"统计计算","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-modeling-r","title":"R 统计建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/statistical-modeling-r"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bayesian-analysis-r","title":"贝叶斯分析与 Stan/brms","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/bayesian-analysis-r"},{"seq":3,"slug":"survival-analysis-r","title":"生存分析与临床统计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/survival-analysis-r"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shiny-interactive-apps","title":"Shiny 交互式应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/shiny-interactive-apps"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rmarkdown-quarto","title":"R Markdown 与 Quarto 报告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/rmarkdown-quarto"},{"seq":3,"slug":"r-performance-scaling","title":"R 性能优化与大数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/r-performance-scaling"}]}]}